{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Runemaster Magic Etchings: Primordial Blast damage stacks Leybreaker armor reduction (#1661)",
  "contract": [
    "Magic Etchings 300582 (Runic tree talent, CharacterAdvancement 1734): 'Dealing damage with Primordial Blast",
    "now reduces the affected target's armor by $520555s1% for $520555d, stacking $520555u times.' Effect 0 is",
    "PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL 520555 at ProcChance 100; Spell.dbc gives 300582 ProcFlags 0 and no spell_proc row existed,",
    "so the aura never procced. Leybreaker 520555 is SPELL_AURA_MOD_RESISTANCE_PCT on armor (MiscValue 1),",
    "BasePoints -5 with DieSides 1 = -4%, TARGET_UNIT_TARGET_ENEMY, SpellDuration 29 = 12 sec, StackAmount 5.",
    "Primordial Blast 800732 is a magic-class family 38 spell whose mask1 0x100000 it shares only with its ranks,",
    "its elemental versions and two non-damaging helpers. Expected: without the talent a Primordial Blast hit",
    "applies nothing; with it each hit adds one Leybreaker stack owned by the Runemaster, armor falls to 96% after",
    "one hit and to 80% after five, a sixth hit keeps 5 stacks, and each application lasts 12 sec."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "location": {"map": 0, "x": -8949.95, "y": -132.493, "z": 83.5312, "o": 0},
  "players": [
    {"id": "rm", "race": 1, "class": 32, "level": 80, "spell_hit_rating": 10000}
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {"id": "golem", "owner": "rm", "entry": 36, "level": 80, "health": 1000000, "distance": 3}
  ],
  "steps": [
